cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use TTNumPy in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "TTNumPy: tensor-train toolbox for numerical linear algebra"
version: 0.2.0
date-released: 2026-11-02
license: AGPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: "https://github.com/QBoard-public/ttnumpy"
url: "https://qboard-public.github.io/ttnumpy/"
abstract: >-
  TTNumPy is a Python library for numerical linear algebra in the
  tensor-train format: TT and TTM containers, TT-SVD and rounding,
  quantized tensor trains, the ALS, MALS and AMEn linear solvers and
  tensor cross interpolation.
keywords:
  - tensor train
  - TT
  - QTT
  - matrix product states
  - MPS
  - tensor networks
  - low-rank
  - numerical linear algebra
  - cross interpolation
  - TCI
  - ALS
  - MALS
  - AMEn
authors:
  - family-names: Tatarkin
    given-names: Oleg
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0007-3988-8528"
  - family-names: Usmanov
    given-names: Sergey
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0007-9709-8217"
    affiliation: "Cloud Quantum Technologies Limited Liability Company"
